## Summary

**Task:** P4/0248 — ship a native Apple SwiftUI parity of the system-status `InfrastructureSection` (`features/system/components/status/InfrastructureSection.tsx`).

**Critical finding & resolution:** Two auto-generated prompts (0006 *devtools* and 0248 *system-status*) are different web components that the generator pointed at the **same** native path. 0006 was already committed and gate-passed. To honor the Honesty Covenant ("No predecessor bypass") I shipped this distinct surface as **`InfrastructureStatusSection.*`** (9 files, same directory) with the prompt-required diagnostics slug `"InfrastructureSection"`, all symbols prefixed to avoid collisions — documented explicitly in the log.

**Delivered (parity with the web source):**
- Collapsible accordion (Globe + Connected/Disconnected pill) → **SSE Connection** card (Wi-Fi icon, KV rows incl. a connection-state badge) + **Polling Engine** card (Active/Standby badge, speed-comparison rows) + **database-pool** metrics (Total/Acquired/Idle, `fmtInt`).
- P1/S8 two-query state-holder seam (no view networking), P1/S11 `view.opened` telemetry, P1/S10 i18n facade (every web `t()` key reproduced), P1/S9 tokens, shared `TS*` components.
- All six states (loading/empty/error+retry/stale/offline-cached/ready) + full VoiceOver/Dynamic-Type/reduce-motion a11y.

**Verification (all real output):**
- `swift test` host harness: **25/25 green** (adapter/model/a11y).
- `swift build` against the **real** component library: **Build complete** (all 7 view files, Previews included).
- `swiftlint --strict` (1719 files): **0 violations**; `swiftformat --lint`: **0**; placeholder gate: **0**.
- iOS + macOS `xcodebuild`: **65 (DEFERRED)** — 1358 errors are **pre-existing baseline breakage in ~15 other surfaces** (TelemetryErrors*/TemperatureMetricCards/`DashboardWidgetSize` collisions); **zero in my surface** — exactly the documented 0006 precedent.

**Committed** (`a3babda79`): only the 9 surface files + the gate log. The minimal working-tree wiring (`project.yml` XCTest search paths + a behavior-preserving lint-fix extraction in `LifetimeStatsWidget.Adapter.swift`) is left uncommitted and documented, per the 0006 precedent. Log ends `EXIT=0 / STATUS=DONE`.

